# Legacy reference file.
#
# Rate/connection zones and route-specific limits are now integrated directly into:
#   deploy/nginx.reseller-platform.conf
#
# Do NOT copy this file into /etc/nginx/conf.d alongside that site configuration, because nginx
# zone names must be declared exactly once. Install the production configuration with:
#   bash /opt/reseller-platform/scripts/apply-nginx-security.sh
#
# Cloudflare real-IP trust is intentionally not enabled by this repository. Only enable
# `real_ip_header CF-Connecting-IP` after the origin firewall accepts ports 80/443 exclusively
# from Cloudflare's published IP ranges; otherwise clients can spoof their address and bypass
# per-IP limits.
